WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.154
Open the installer you downloaded.

2
00:00:03.724 --> 00:00:10.589
Windows SmartScreen shows a one-time
warning. Choose More info, then Run anyway.

3
00:00:11.159 --> 00:00:17.117
The installer sets up Scry Sync for your
user only, with no administrator prompt.

4
00:00:17.687 --> 00:00:22.152
When it finishes, Scry Sync opens on its
sign-in screen.
